	(text_box "Shutdown_Force has pull-up to input voltage (not a logic voltage) because it takes some time for logic power supplies to turn on, when Snickerdoodle is first powered up.  This scheme holds all amplifiers in shutdown even when +3.3V isn't yet present, until the software can explicitly turn everything on when it's ready."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 251.46 162.56 0)
		(size 59.69 13.97)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
